  clock: 6  # 09c1
  nonce: 09c1  # 09c1
  message: "Done in PR #1699 (merged via auto-pr per owner approval). ci-debug gains an explicit --actions arm: runs [workflow] [N], status <run-id>, logs <run-id> [job], artifact <run-id> <name> <new-empty-dir>; read-only GETs via api_get; the default Woodpecker arm is unchanged. Behavioural evidence, live on dev after merge: 'ci-debug runs --actions release.yml' lists the release runs (39068691320 failure/workflow_dispatch, 38899828875 failure/v9.1.0, 38649503505 success/v9.0.0 ...); 'status --actions 39068691320' renders security-audit success 69s, io-manifest failure 113s with the FAIL step 'Trace the corpus...' 76s, build-and-publish skipped; 'logs --actions 39068691320' and 'artifact --actions 39068691320 io-manifest <dir>' both exit 3 naming productionresultssa0.blob.core.windows.net, which ALLOWED_WEBSITES.md does not list, and make no request to it. Pinned by tests/test_ci_debug_actions.py (24 tests) through the fake-curl harness, which learned redirects/-L/body_b64. Open follow-up for the owner: whether to list that storage host (GitHub serves job logs and artifact zips from productionresultssa<N>.blob.core.windows.net); until then logs/artifact are gated by design."  # 09c1
