  message: "Follow-up merged in PR #1700: ALLOWED_WEBSITES.md lists productionresultssa*.blob.core.windows.net (one * per label; rationale and scope limit in the file) and the ci-debug matcher honours it. Live from dev after merge: 'logs --actions 39068691320 io-manifest' returns the job log; 'artifact --actions 39068691320 io-manifest <dir>' extracts 26 files, byte-identical to the gh-fetched copy. All four --actions views now work through the approved script; the one-off gh waiver is no longer needed."  # da50
